Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.51,0:00:07.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:18.72,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:23.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:27.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:34.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:41.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:49.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:55.48,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:59.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:03.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:10.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:21.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:39.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好悠闲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:43.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 之前的战斗仿佛假的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.57,0:01:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂碎片的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:47.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且正在接近中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:56.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:57.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:01:59.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我嗅到戈薇的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特地来见你的 过的还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:04.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有何指教 瘦皮狼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.65,0:02:08.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 不可以一见面就打架喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 要不是这种情形… 我马上宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一点都没变 烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:17.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次看到你都 紧张兮兮叽叽呱呱的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:20.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 跟这种人在一起不累吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等… 喂 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扯一些没礼貌的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“犬夜叉只是觉得 戈薇会被抢走而焦急”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:30.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你老是这么想 就大错特错了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:31.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 别跟着起哄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是一刻都不得闲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第46话 兽郎丸与影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:48.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你奈落城的所在位置？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是白痴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.03,0:02:52.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道的话我们就不会这么累了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那家伙 在城的周围布满了结界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:03:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为同伴报仇的事就交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要把双脚的 四魂之玉碎片交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再乖乖躲回 巢穴里发抖就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挥刀意外的迟钝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:15.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙还是很重吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:20.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 怎么可能突然变轻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:22.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有种就别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:23.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:26.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没空在这跟烂狗吵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大烂狗 在我杀了奈落之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇就先让你保管
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你敢动她 我就要你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙连逃走的时候 都自信满满呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:42.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着发那么大的脾气嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:47.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候发脾气啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:53.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我很高兴他为我吃醋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但就不能用温柔点的方式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:03:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是有够累人的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟…跟我在一起真的那么累吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.31,0:04:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在沮丧什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:11.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着在意钢牙说的话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他是在意戈薇小姐说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虫？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:31.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢 钢牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个味道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:37.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟神乐一样…绝对没错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.93,0:05:00.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的少主…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:04.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到你比犬夜叉 早一步闻到我的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.50,0:05:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…是奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:10.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那个叫神乐的女人 相同的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙就是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远忘不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:17.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同伴被你杀害的仇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:20.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我要在这讨回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当作我新的分身的饵食吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笼子？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:38.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 我是不知道你载着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:40.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里撞见我是你气数已尽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要报我同伴的仇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的对手是这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:50.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 兽郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:09.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子怎么搞的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:11.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先收拾这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:15.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再将你们通通解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:17.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 奈落！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快拿掉这小子的辔头跟锁链
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付你这样就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.98,0:06:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:32.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子动作真快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使受限制了还是比我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:50.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 更重要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股寒气是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子的辔头里…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要单独行动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就还不能 好好的使用铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:11.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有恶心的钢牙那家伙的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:17.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要收拾奈落的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可以让钢牙抢先
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 我现在忙得很
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然能追上我的脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 原来你在逃跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:44.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:50.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于来了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:08:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙仇也不报就逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.77,0:08:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我想象中要识相多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:08.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拿我跟那个 胆小鬼瘦皮狼相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…新的奈落分身吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兽郎丸 我就解开你的封印
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你放手一搏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解开辔头的兽郎丸谁都挡不住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到把这里所有人杀光为止
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的 这个叫兽郎丸的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阴阳怪气的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.19,0:08:58.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总归是奈落的傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:09:01.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是却打掉了 应该是自己人的奈落的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙敌我不分吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才被辔头与锁链封印了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.87,0:09:12.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么轻易就被打中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是陷阱吗？不…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子怎么看都不像是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:25.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会卖弄小聪明战斗的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:29.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一口气解决掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:33.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不相上下？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:45.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手腕变长了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:49.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙的身体能变化吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到奈落了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:09:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是逃回来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 是直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姑且不论奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带的那个头怪怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:09.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散发出非常危险的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:11.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的直觉绝对不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:13.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 凭这一点就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉真是个大傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:18.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这时候他肯定是 被兽郎丸打得哭爹喊娘啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还遇到犬夜叉呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 钢牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是我们多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和犬夜叉在一起的戈薇大姐 不是也危险了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:36.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帐东西 为什么不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该自己发觉到嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个浑蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:51.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砍断手腕了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有砍到的触感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:58.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是自行从兽狼丸身上分离
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:08.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手腕又接上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那个根本不是手腕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…从地面？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:26.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子的内脏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:33.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,味道真是不错 兽郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…居然还有一只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:43.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:47.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沉睡在兽郎丸的肚子里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在兽郎丸的肚子里…那么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:54.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辔头是为了封印你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为兽郎丸只服从我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.11,0:12:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使对像是奈落也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 剩下的人也处理掉吧 兽郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:07.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽情的吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:35.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在吸哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:40.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭这种速度也想打倒我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:57.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的刀比较恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.93,0:13:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就躲到被窝里睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你还不能乱动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子已经开了个洞啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 这只是家常便饭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.55,0:13:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人的命 我要了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:42.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大烂狗 你在干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然让戈薇遭受这种危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:46.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就夹着尾巴逃掉还敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只有这次 才跟你道谢 大混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我刚才的处境十分危险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:13:57.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:13:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只怪模怪样的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.19,0:14:05.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从兽郎丸的肚子里跑出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:06.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪不得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从兽郎丸身上感受到的寒气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:11.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这家伙的关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.90,0:14:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫影郎丸的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:16.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作快到我们追不上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:19.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们以为我是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:22.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没有能 从我脚底下逃走的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有嘴巴厉害而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很敢说嘛！我要把你捏碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连嘴皮子也不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:37.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的速度不过如此吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.93,0:14:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兽郎丸 你的对手是本大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:49.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢人现眼了 烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连那只笨妖怪都束手无策吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！这浑蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是连影郎丸都抓不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拿我和你相提并论
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渐渐看得见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他抢在影郎丸的前面了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:26.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你死！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:28.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打中了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:33.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又逃掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…从土里？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:47.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.73,0:15:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 又潜下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:59.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好！脚被封住就没有胜算了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉还倒在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该吃那女人的内脏了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,影郎丸 你敢碰戈薇…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:16.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你连骨头都吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.99,0:16:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你休想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:37.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…是刀变轻了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:40.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他用单手挥动铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他头脑简单
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概脑袋被冲昏 忘记重量了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:47.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁头脑简单啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.89,0:16:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又潜下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉才是 好严重的伤…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烂狗 你还活着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙的脚也中招了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子一点用都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开吧 瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我把兽郎丸砍成两…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又变重了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然刚才是因为 一心要保护戈薇才会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.02,0:17:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会在旁边吠的胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:21.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么…吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便连你也一起砍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.93,0:17:34.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会道谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就说声谢嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战斗再拖下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.65,0:17:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体也会撑不下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道潜入地底的 影郎丸会从哪里袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:54.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.35,0:17:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是至少能封住 土里的影郎丸的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:17:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 锡杖借一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:00.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么策略吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:05.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种毒…虽然效果不长
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要逼出影郎丸应该够了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:16.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土变红了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点抓住影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土里的毒应该会让他动作变慢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:29.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没出息的烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下爬不起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:45.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！你振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:47.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别慌张 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来我一个人就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:52.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要没有碍手碍脚的影郎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一只白痴妖怪是轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:58.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩这一只就一口气打倒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,影郎丸的气息消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是潜到暗处了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.13,0:19:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！钢牙 快回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烂狗就躲起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:18.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:25.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让开的话 我就连你一起砍成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.35,0:19:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得手了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:33.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才发现太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:34.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:51.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,粉身碎骨了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 害我花了那么多功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:19:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是打算连我一起宰了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:04.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然是这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:05.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.79,0:20:07.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 我要宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等 等一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:10.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完全没有半点犹豫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就狠狠的一刀劈过来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.53,0:20:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为他认为
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:16.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以钢牙的速度一定能够避开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧 犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不了 罗唆的瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再发牢骚我就真的劈下去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好笑 有本事就来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个没死透的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:32.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 今天就先离开好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:40.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明受了重伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有想过再打下去 会有什么后果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.32,0:20:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 今天真的很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.56,0:20:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏你帮了大忙 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.30,0:20:52.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认为这样 钢牙就会乖乖回去…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:20:56.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:21:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能放心把你 交给那一无是处的烂狗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:03.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 居然让他胡言乱语
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.94,0:21:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你有危险的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.35,0:21:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会来救你的 再见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:13.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我站住 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.82,0:21:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又把钢牙放走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为 犬夜叉的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.83,0:21:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会输给那只瘦皮狼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之先治疗伤口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:31.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说过不用了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且刚才那什么态度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了讨好那家伙还向他谄媚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是丢人现眼 让人看不下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正你啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那 那什么眼神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.15,0:21:49.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.69,0:21:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回家去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去啊 我才不会拦你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:58.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉…话说完了就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要好好帮法师疗伤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.67,0:22:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这样子 真是长不大呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.62,0:22:30.53,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:42.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:49.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.42,0:22:53.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:57.88,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.93,0:23:04.53,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:12.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:19.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:27.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:35.36,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.02,0:23:49.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前设下陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:52.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让犬夜叉和桔梗 自相残杀的奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在又布下了天罗地网 要除掉桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.23,0:23:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己体内残留的 鬼蜘蛛的心仰慕着桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎很痛恨这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:01.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗的危机
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.07,0:24:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉不可能置之不理
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:05.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是为什么 犬夜叉？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.04,0:24:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何与桔梗那样抱在一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.71,0:24:11.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.31,0:24:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落残留的鬼蜘蛛灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
